                    # f32v4 + integer vectors i8v16..u64v2) returns register-class
                    # (SysV pair / XMM0), NOT via retptr. Catch them ALL uniformly
                    # through the shared classifier so a new vector type can never
                    # silently default to the retptr-stash — the Phase-1 f32v4
                    # SIGSEGV class. (Scalars classify non-vector → _is_simd_any 0;
                    # structs classify to a +sid → 0. So this only fires for vectors,
                    # byte-identical for every existing return type.)
